  faqSchema({
    questions: [
      { question: "Why does my WD Elements work on one computer but not another?", answer: "The problem can be the USB port, cable, hub, operating-system state, or power available on that connection. Western Digital recommends testing with the supplied cable and a direct computer connection before assuming the drive has failed." },
      { question: "Can I use a WD Elements drive through a USB hub?", answer: "Possibly, but hubs add another power and signal path. For troubleshooting, connect the drive directly to the computer. If it works directly but not through the hub, investigate the hub and its power capability." },
